i (conversational automation), and Mad Street Den (retail vision AI). Current hiring movement is strongest in applied ML, data engineering, evaluation, AI product management, and domain analytics. Student starter stack for the next 12 months: Python, SQL, statistics, communication, and mini-project execution."],"\n              ",["P",{"class":"awareness-relevance"},"Career Track: AI & Data Careers (2026-2036)"],"\n              ",["P",{"class":"awareness-relevance"},"Skill Focus: Coding, Statistics, Data Literacy, Product Thinking"],"\n              ",["P",{"class":"awareness-relevance"},"Parent Action: choose one AI startup use-case with your child and map skill gaps in AptiPath360."],"\n              ",["A",{"class":"awareness-link","href":"/insights/13/indian-ai-startup-hiring-signals-2026-sarvam-ai-krutrim-fractal-yellow-ai"},"Read Full Brief →"],"\n              \n              ",["A",{"class":"awareness-link","href":"/registerParentChild?plan=career-basic&redirect=/plans/checkout?plan=career-basic"},"Start AptiPath360 →"],"\n            "],"\n          "],"\n        \n          ",["ARTICLE",{"class":"startup-desk-card awareness-card","data-headline":"India EV and Climate Startup Signals 2026: Ather, Ola Electric, Exponent, Log9"},"\n            \n              \n              \n                ",["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://robodynamics.in/resources/images/Ai3.jpg","src":"/resources/images/Ai3.jpg","alt":"India EV and Climate Startup Signals 2026: Ather, Ola Electric, Exponent, Log9"}],"\n              \n            \n            ",["DIV",{"class":"startup-desk-content"},"\n              ",["DIV",{"class":"awareness-meta"},"\n                ",["SPAN",{"class":"awareness-type"},"India Startup"],"\n                ",["SPAN",{"class":"awareness-readtime"},"1 min read"],"\n              "],"\n              ",["H3",{},"India EV and Climate Startup Signals 2026: Ather, Ola Electric, Exponent, Log9"],"\n              ",["P",{},"Companies in focus: Ather and Ola Electric (EV products), Exponent and Log9 (battery and charging innovation), Ultraviolette (performance EV engineering). Hiring signals: battery systems, embedded electronics, quality operations, vehicle software, and product testing. Student skill map: physics, chemistry, CAD basics, coding fundamentals, and systems thinking."],"\n              ",["P",{"class":"awareness-relevance"},"Career Track: EV & ClimateTech Careers (2026-2036)"],"\n              ",["P",{"class":"awareness-relevance"},"Skill Focus: Science, Product Design, Engineering Basics, Data Use"],"\n              ",["P",{"class":"awareness-relevance"},"Parent Action: discuss one EV or climate startup with your child and map science-to-career actions in AptiPath360."],"\n              ",["A",{"class":"awareness-link","href":"/insights/12/india-ev-and-climate-startup-signals-2026-ather-ola-electric-exponent-log9"},"Read Full Brief →"],"\n              \n                ",["A",{"class":"awareness-link","href":"https://www.ecampusnews.com/ai-in-education/2026/02/23/most-students-must-use-ai-for-classwork/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener"},"Reference Source (ecampusnews.com) →"],"\n              \n              ",["A",{"class":"awareness-link","href":"/registerParentChild?plan=career-basic&redirect=/plans/checkout?plan=career-basic"},"Start AptiPath360 →"],"\n            "],"\n          "],"\n        \n          ",["ARTICLE",{"class":"startup-desk-card awareness-card","data-headline":"India Startup and Future Careers Brief 2026: Sector Signals and Student Skill Map"},"\n            \n              \n              \n                ",["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://robodynamics.in/resources/images/Ai.jpg","src":"/resources/images/Ai.jpg","alt":"India Startup and Future Careers Brief 2026: Sector Signals and Student Skill Map"}],"\n              \n            \n            ",["DIV",{"class":"startup-desk-content"},"\n              ",["DIV",{"class":"awareness-meta"},"\n                ",["SPAN",{"class":"awareness-type"},"India Startup"],"\n                ",["SPAN",{"class":"awareness-readtime"},"1 min read"],"\n              "],"\n              ",["H3",{},"India Startup and Future Careers Brief 2026: Sector Signals and Student Skill Map"],"\n              ",["P",{},"Compiled brief: Career trends become useful only when converted into weekly student actions. This update maps India-focused future careers to practical learning steps. Hiring signals are stronger in AI/Data, SpaceTech, EV/Climate, and product-led startups. Student skill map: coding fundamentals, data literacy, science-math rigor, communication, and execution discipline through mini projects."],"\n              ",["P",{"class":"awareness-relevance"},"Career Track: Future Careers in India (2026-2036)"],"\n              ",["P",{"class":"awareness-relevance"},"Skill Focus: Core STEM + Communication + Decision Skills"],"\n              ",["P",{"class":"awareness-relevance"},"Parent Action: use AptiPath360 to convert this insight into a monthly child skill plan."],"\n              ",["A",{"class":"awareness-link","href":"/insights/15/india-startup-and-future-careers-brief-2026-sector-signals-and-student-skill-map"},"Read Full Brief →"],"\n              \n              ",["A",{"class":"awareness-link","href":"/registerParentChild?plan=career-basic&redirect=/plans/checkout?plan=career-basic"},"Start AptiPath360 →"],"\n            "],"\n          "],"\n        \n          ",["ARTICLE",{"class":"startup-desk-card awareness-card","data-headline":"India Curriculum and Career Shift 2026: What CBSE/NCERT Updates Mean for Students"},"\n            \n              \n              \n                ",["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://robodynamics.in/resources/images/mega-olympiad.png","src":"/resources/images/mega-olympiad.png","alt":"India Curriculum and Career Shift 2026: What CBSE/NCERT Updates Mean for Students"}],"\n              \n            \n            ",["DIV",{"class":